OL,3,ABurnham calls summit of Welsh, Scottish
OL,4,Aand Northern Irish first ministers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham says he will bring
OL,7,Ftogether the leaders of Wales, Scotland
OL,8,Fand Northern Ireland in the autumn for
OL,9,Fa summit to help boost the UK economy.
OL,11,FHe made the announcement ahead of a
OL,12,Fvisit to south Wales on Thursday - his
OL,13,Ffirst official visit to the country
OL,14,Fsince he became prime minister.
OL,16,FBurnham said he wanted "every leader in
OL,17,Fthis country signed up" to having "good
OL,18,Fjobs in every community".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
